aption":"This is why I love this place and why it will always remain one of my top restaurants in Dubai ⭐️ Not only is the food consistently excellent but they’re doing stuff no one else is doing in the city 👏 Unlimited Alaskan king crab for 299 per person and it is flawless. It’s rich, super buttery…It’s a masterpiece 🔥 Also, a huge thanks to @burakpazarlioglu for making our night absolutely hilarious 🤣 @theguilddubai 📍 ICD Brookfield Place, DIFC #dubaifood #dubaieats #dubaifoodie #dubairestaurants #kingcrab ","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_7f36c32b4c51681eb24880b2ac20","publishedAt":"2026-07-09T13:45:00.000Z","profileId":"prf_676749f00a197fb457883590d700","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7660438772491783455/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":1800000,"likesCount":106800,"sharesCount":28000,"commentsCount":830,"interactionsCount":135630,"engagementRatePerViews":7.535,"engagementRatePerFollowers":71.23424369747899,"profileFollowersCount":190400,"profileFollowingCount":236,"profilePostsCount":670,"mediaCount":1,"duration":44,"hashtags":["#dubaifood","#dubaieats","#dubaifoodie","#dubairestaurants","#kingcrab"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[],"platformId":"7660438772491783455","profilePlatformId":"6764292116183024646","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/justfooddxb/pfp.webp","profileBio":"🍕No bulls*it, Just Food \n🏆Top 3 Food Guide UAE \n📥 Alex@zodiacglobal.com","profileVerified":true,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"This is one of my top 10 restaurants in the UAE, and this is why they do stuff like this. They do an unlimited king crab night. This is smoked butter overnight with Alaskan king crab. De-shelled, no fat, no scissors. This is just all you can eat buttery crab. This is why you come to the guild, because they're doing stuff that no one else is doing. All right, go. Here we go. I didn't realize how good crab could be until I tasted that. Go on then. Oh no. He's an animal. Thank you, Jeff. That was fast. Thank you. Thank you. That was fast.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.047,"endSeconds":2.447,"text":"This is one of my top 10 restaurants in the UAE,"},{"startSeconds":2.447,"endSeconds":5.027,"text":"and this is why they do stuff like this."},{"startSeconds":5.027,"endSeconds":7.247,"text":"They do an unlimited king crab night."},{"startSeconds":7.247,"endSeconds":10.927,"text":"This is smoked butter overnight with Alaskan king crab."},{"startSeconds":10.927,"endSeconds":13.787,"text":"De-shelled, no fat, no scissors."},{"startSeconds":13.787,"endSeconds":17.407,"text":"This is just all you can eat buttery crab."},{"startSeconds":17.407,"endSeconds":18.667,"text":"This is why you come to the guild,"},{"startSeconds":18.667,"endSeconds":21.127,"text":"because they're doing stuff that no one else is doing."},{"startSeconds":21.127,"endSeconds":22.127,"text":"All right, go."},{"startSeconds":22.127,"endSeconds":22.967,"text":"Here we go."},{"startSeconds":22.967,"endSeconds":31.247,"text":"I didn't realize how good crab could be until I tasted that."},{"startSeconds":31.247,"endSeconds":32.747,"text":"Go on then."},{"startSeconds":32.747,"endSeconds":33.747,"text":"Oh no."},{"startSeconds":33.747,"endSeconds":38.747,"text":"He's an animal."},{"startSeconds":38.747,"endSeconds":39.747,"text":"Thank you, Jeff."},{"startSeconds":39.747,"endSeconds":41.087,"text":"That was fast."},{"startSeconds":41.087,"endSeconds":42.087,"text":"Thank you."},{"startSeconds":42.087,"endSeconds":42.687,"text":"Thank you."},{"startSeconds":42.687,"endSeconds":43.687,"text":"That was fast."}],"frames":[{"id":"med_24050c5e7f1929a863d76b8f5414","position":1,"timestampSeconds":0.1,"url":"https://oriane-frames